        "id": 201460,
        "name": "Blackfang108",
        "username": "Blackfang108",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-14T20:27:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm just lost at this one. No matter what track I try to take I keep ending up with her basically healed up, a million cards under her, her entire crew out, and me with no stuff and no HP. Trying to do what others said they did and kill Mabel or the ship–usually my first two targets with her–just ended up with them right back out a turn or two later. I never see any deck control cards until too late plus the ship keeps shuffling things anyway. She keeps playing the card that gives her massive lightning damage or playing Walk the Plank on Expat every time I turn around, not that Expat ever has any guns to use anyway, often followed up by the ongoing wipe card.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Indeed.&nbsp; I needed to step away from this and try something easier.&nbsp; I decided on an game of Random against Iron Legacy.&nbsp; It was easier.</p>",
